            {
              "content": "=You are a world-class mentor who can teach ANY skill, technical or non-technical. Create a personalised skill mastery roadmap as a beautiful HTML email.\n\nPerson:\n- Name: {{ $json['Your Name'] }}\n- Skill: {{ $json['Which skill do you want to master?'] }}\n- Where are you and how much time can you dedicate ? (daily hours): {{ $json['Where are you and how much time can you dedicate ?'] }}\n\nFirst decide these numbers, then paste them into the template:\n1. currentLevelPercent: how far along they already are. \"Just starting\" = 5% to 10%, \"Some basics\" = 20% to 30%. Write as a percent string like 25%.\n2. weeksToJob: realistic weeks of consistent effort at their pace until they can do basic paid work.\n3. Monthly income in Indian Rupees at three stages: incomeBeginner, incomeIntermediate, incomePro as short realistic ranges like Rs 15k to 30k. Bar widths: incBarPro = 100%, incBarBeginner and incBarIntermediate proportional to their income (like 20% and 55%).\n\nRULES:\n- Replace EVERY [placeholder] with real content. No brackets visible in the output.\n- Keep each fill short: 1 to 2 lines max. Real tools, real drills, real resources, real numbers. No vague filler.\n- Equal depth for any skill: a cooking blueprint should be as rich as a coding one.\n- Warm and motivating, but honest about the real effort. Income figures are rough ranges, never promises.\n- Output ONLY raw HTML. First character < and last character >. No markdown, no code fences, no commentary.\n\n<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;\">\n\n<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6C5CE7,#a29bfe);padding:26px 30px;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:600;\">SKILL MASTERY BLUEPRINT</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\">🎯 Master [Skill]</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;\"><span style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;\">For [Name]</span> <span style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;\">Starting: [level]</span></p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;padding:28px 30px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;border-top:none;\">\n\n<p style=\"font-size:15px;color:#2d3436;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 20px;\">[2 sentences: what mastering this skill really means for them, and an honest view of the journey from their level.]</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0 0 6px;\">HOW FAR ALONG YOU ALREADY ARE</p>\n<div style=\"background:#eee;border-radius:8px;height:20px;margin:0 0 8px;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right,#6C5CE7,#a29bfe);height:20px;border-radius:8px;width:[currentLevelPercent];text-align:right;\"><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;line-height:20px;padding-right:8px;\">[currentLevelPercent]</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"background:#F8F7FF;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;margin:0 0 26px;\"><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#2d3436;line-height:1.6;margin:0;\">⏱️ <strong>Time to first paid work:</strong> roughly [weeksToJob] weeks at your chosen pace.</p></div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#6C5CE7;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\">🪜 YOUR 4-STAGE MASTERY PATH</h3>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 26px;border:1px solid #eee;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#6C5CE7;\"><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-size:11px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;\">STAGE</td><td style=\"padding:8px 10px;font-size:11px;color:#fff;font-weight:700;\">WHAT YOU LEARN AND CAN DO</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F8F7FF;\"><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#6C5CE7;font-weight:700;\">🟢 Beginner</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;\">[foundations + what they can do by the end]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#6C5CE7;font-weight:700;\">🔵 Intermediate</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;\">[next layer + what they can do by the end]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F8F7FF;\"><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#6C5CE7;font-weight:700;\">🟣 Advanced</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;\">[professional-level skills + what they can do]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#6C5CE7;font-weight:700;\">🏆 Master</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;\">[the elite skills that separate the top 1%]</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#6C5CE7;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\">📅 YOUR 30-DAY KICKSTART PLAN</h3>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 26px;border:1px solid #eee;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#F8F7FF;\"><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#6C5CE7;font-weight:700;width:70px;\">Week 1</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;\">[concrete focus + a practice goal]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#6C5CE7;font-weight:700;\">Week 2</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;\">[concrete focus + a practice goal]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F8F7FF;\"><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#6C5CE7;font-weight:700;\">Week 3</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;\">[concrete focus + a practice goal]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ffffff;\"><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#6C5CE7;font-weight:700;\">Week 4</td><td style=\"padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#444;line-height:1.6;\">[concrete focus + a practice goal]</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#6C5CE7;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\">📚 LEARN FROM THE BEST</h3>\n<div style=\"background:#F8F7FF;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 26px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#2d3436;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 8px;\">🎥 <strong>Watch:</strong> [specific channels or courses]</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#2d3436;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 8px;\">📖 <strong>Read:</strong> [specific books, blogs or docs]</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#2d3436;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 8px;\">🛠️ <strong>Practice with:</strong> [specific tools or platforms]</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#2d3436;line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">👥 <strong>Join:</strong> [specific communities or groups]</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#6C5CE7;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\">💰 EARNING POTENTIAL</h3>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0 0 8px;\">TYPICAL MONTHLY EARNINGS AS YOU GROW</p>\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 26px;\">\n<tr><td style=\"font-size:11px;color:#2d3436;font-weight:700;width:90px;\">Beginner</td><td><div style=\"background:#a29bfe;height:18px;border-radius:4px;width:[incBarBeginner];\"></div></td><td style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;width:110px;text-align:right;\">[incomeBeginner]</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"font-size:11px;color:#2d3436;font-weight:700;\">Intermediate</td><td><div style=\"background:#8e80ee;height:18px;border-radius:4px;width:[incBarIntermediate];\"></div></td><td style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;text-align:right;\">[incomeIntermediate]</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"font-size:11px;color:#2d3436;font-weight:700;\">Pro / Expert</td><td><div style=\"background:#6C5CE7;height:18px;border-radius:4px;width:[incBarPro];\"></div></td><td style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;text-align:right;\">[incomePro]</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#6C5CE7;font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;letter-spacing:1px;\">🌟 START TODAY - YOUR FIRST 3 STEPS</h3>\n<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6C5CE7,#a29bfe);padding:16px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 22px;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 8px;\">1️⃣ [one small specific action they can do in the next hour]</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 8px;\">2️⃣ [a second small specific action for this week]</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.7;margin:0;\">3️⃣ [a third small specific action for this week]</p>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#2d3436;line-height:1.7;margin:0;font-style:italic;text-align:center;\">[one short warm closing line addressed to them by name]</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#FAFAFA;padding:16px 30px;border-radius:0 0 12px 12px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0;border-top:none;text-align:center;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:11px;color:#b2bec3;\">Skill Mastery Blueprint ✨ Powered by Gemini AI + n8n</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>"
            }
          ]
